Execute an OpenSearch query against the carrier index.

This is faster than /match as it bypasses embeddings. The agent constructs
the query directly using OpenSearch Query DSL.

**Example - Fuzzy name search**:
```json
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {"match": {"name": {"query": "Liberty Mutual", "fuzziness": "AUTO"}}}
      ],
      "filter": [
        {"term": {"is_active": true}}
      ]
    }
  },
  "size": 10
}
```

