Execute an OpenSearch query against the coverage type (ProductLine) index.

**Example - Name search**:
```json
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [{"match": {"display_name": {"query": "Cyber", "fuzziness": "AUTO"}}}],
      "filter": [{"term": {"is_active": true}}]
    }
  },
  "size": 10
}
```

**Example - Exact code match**:
```json
{
  "query": {
    "term": {"code": "CYBER"}
  }
}
```

**Index Fields**:
- `display_name` (text, boosted): Display name (e.g., "Cyber Liability")
