Execute an OpenSearch query against the wholesaler index.

This endpoint searches both wholesalers AND MGAs (same model).
The agent determines from context whether to use the ID as wholesaler_id or mga_id.

**Example - Name search**:
```json
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [{"match": {"name": {"query": "CRC Insurance", "fuzziness": "AUTO"}}}],
      "filter": [{"term": {"is_active": true}}]
    }
  },
  "size": 10
}
```

**Index Fields**:
- `name` (text, boosted): Wholesaler/MGA name
